    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988320/extras/9f91e64bef91f07d6c5d35c24a496047.avif?t=1693988635\" /></div><br><br>Interested in Finnish culture or simply a lover of cute animals and snow?<br>Sanonta is a memory/clicker game where our charming Finnish girl Aino tells you fun facts about Finland and shares her favorite Finnish proverbs, English translated of course!<br><br>    \u2022 Enjoy a large collection of Finnish proverbs imbued with ancient Nordic wisdom.<br><br>    \u2022 Play simple memory/clicker mini games to advance and unlock more proverbs.<br><br>    \u2022 6 different levels, all featuring common Finnish locations and themes.<br>      <br>    \u2022 All levels have unique Finland facts to unlock.<br>      <br>    \u2022 A cute card deck with 18 different pictures of common Finnish animals and birds.<br><br>    \u2022 Enjoy relaxing, hurry-free gameplay.<br><br>    \u2022 Calming soundtrack.<br>      <br>    \u2022 Full controller support.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988320/extras/9f91e64bef91f07d6c5d35c24a496047.avif?t=1693988635\" /></div><br><br>Interested in Finnish culture or simply a lover of cute animals and snow?<br>Sanonta is a memory/clicker game where our charming Finnish girl Aino tells you fun facts about Finland and shares her favorite Finnish proverbs, English translated of course!<br><br>    \u2022 Enjoy a large collection of Finnish proverbs imbued with ancient Nordic wisdom.<br><br>    \u2022 Play simple memory/clicker mini games to advance and unlock more proverbs.<br><br>    \u2022 6 different levels, all featuring common Finnish locations and themes.<br>      <br>    \u2022 All levels have unique Finland facts to unlock.<br>      <br>    \u2022 A cute card deck with 18 different pictures of common Finnish animals and birds.<br><br>    \u2022 Enjoy relaxing, hurry-free gameplay.<br><br>    \u2022 Calming soundtrack.<br>      <br>    \u2022 Full controller support.",
    "short_description": "Sanonta is a simple memory/clicker game where you unlock funny sayings and proverbs from Finland. May contain: snow, cute animals, a pretty Finnish girl and sisu.",
